---
description: Keep Vietnam investing outputs facts-first and source-explicit
alwaysApply: true
---

For any output based on FireAnt data:
- separate raw facts from interpretation
- explicitly list source = FireAnt
- state method = API or web-side endpoint
- state symbol universe / index names / sectors used
- state date range
- state whether values are native or proxy-derived
- highlight limitations and data integrity warnings

Do not present proxy series as if they were native index series.
Do not present inferred metrics as reported metrics without labeling them as derived.

